### Explore Inspirasi (PRD v0.8). Every request needs a verified account. Ids are UUIDs made by the app.
### Start (201): the first question. 402 without credits, 429 after 10 new sessions in an hour (Retry-After).
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: id

{ "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "interests": ["PHOTO", "SHOPPING"], "text": "street photography" }

### Resume (24 h)
GET {{host}}/explore/inspiration/sessions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Answer with an option id, or { "otherText": "..." } for "Lainnya" (max 80)
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/sessions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "optionId": "domestic" }

### Results: builds the cards and charges once (a repeat charges nothing). "Sudah cukup" from step 3 when no mandatory question is left.
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/sessions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "Tanya lagi": one more question; its answer appends cards (1 free, then the next-batch price)
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/sessions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/ask-again
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit a profile chip (3 free, then the next-batch price)
PATCH {{host}}/explore/inspiration/sessions/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "DURATION", "value": "Sampai 3 hari" }

### Save a card (201). The 31st removes the oldest: removedOldestId names it for the undo snackbar.
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222", "sessionId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "cardId": "c1" }

### Ide tersimpan, newest first
GET {{host}}/explore/inspiration/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Undo that save -> 204 (the pushed-out idea comes back)
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/saved/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222/undo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "Perbarui" -> SavedIdeaDto; once per card per 24 h, then 429 with Retry-After
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/saved/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore a removed idea within 24 h ("Urungkan") -> 204; 409 when the list is full or the card was saved again
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/saved/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove -> 204 (restorable for 24 h)
DELETE {{host}}/explore/inspiration/saved/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "Kabari saya" -> 204
POST {{host}}/explore/inspiration/buddy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "interest": "ADVENTURE" }
